nodes.statement:
For any $\varepsilon >0$, there exists $K=K(\varepsilon)$, such that
\begin{equation}
 \limsup_{n\to\infty}\ensuremath{\mathbbm{P}\left(V_n\notin \mathscr{C}_{\scriptscriptstyle (1)}, |\mathscr{C}(V_n)|>K\right)}<\varepsilon.
\end{equation}
Consequently, for any $L_n$ such that $L_n\to\infty$, as $n\to\infty$, 
\begin{equation}
 \frac{\ensuremath{\mathbbm{E}\left[Q_n(L_n)\right]}}{n}\to 0.
\end{equation}
